==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 21.33~37.33 seconds<sup>640f~1,120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This Outbreak is as straightforward as the regular stage. Immediately start spawning [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] and any other fast units you may have to make the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] burrow and use your usual attackers to deal with them.

